<title>USA: Yields fall on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</title>
<headline>Yields fall on Bond Buyer's weekly indices.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yields on the Bond Buyer municipal bond indices fell this week.</p>
<p>The yield on the 20-bond index of general obligation bonds calculated Thursday, Sept 19, was 5.88 percent, down one basis points from last Thursday.</p>
<p>The yield on the 11-bond index of GO bonds was 5.78 percent, down two basis points from last Thursday.</p>
<p>The yield on the 30-year revenue bond index was 6.10 percent, down two basis points from last Thursday.</p>
<p>20 Bond Index			5.88%   5.89%   9/19/96</p>
<p>11 Bond index			5.78%   5.80%   9/19/96</p>
<p>Revenue Bond Index		 6.10%   6.12%   9/19/96</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
